idue","start":480,"end":480,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":520,"end":520,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Cross-link","start":523,"end":523,"description":"Glycyl lysine isopeptide (Lys-Gly) (interchain with G-Cter in SUMO2)"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Identified in the spliceosome C complex (PubMed:11991638). Component of a ribonucleoprotein complex containing mRNAs and RNA-binding proteins including DDX5, HNRNPH2 and SRSF1 as well as splicing regulator ARVCF (PubMed:24644279). Interacts with RBM4; the interaction occurs in an RNA-independent manner. Interacts with AGO1 and AGO2. Interacts with ESR1, AR, EP300, CREBBP, POLR2A, TP53, RUNX2 and HDAC1. Self-associates. Interacts with DDX17. Interacts with BRDT. The large PER complex involved in the repression of transcriptional termination is composed of at least PER2, CDK9, DDX5, DHX9, NCBP1 and POLR2A (active). Interacts with DHX36; this interaction occurs in a RNA-dependent manner (PubMed:18279852). Interacts with NUPR1 (By similarity). Interacts with ERCC6 (PubMed:26030138). Interacts with DDX3X in the cytoplasm; this interaction may be more efficient when both proteins are unphosphorylated (PubMed:22034099)"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"P17844-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":535,"transcripts":{"ensembl":[],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,84],[85,164,451]],"edits":[{"start":85,"end":163,"original":"RGHNCPKPVLNFYEANFPANVMDVIARQNFTEPTAIQAQG","replacement":"","added":0}],"missing":79,"replaced":0,"novel":0,"foldedAbsent":79,"foldedMissing":79,"features":[[9,29,0],[10,3,0],[11,1,0],[12,39,0],[13,8,0]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-P17844-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-P17844-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":72.5,"plddt":[[0,27],[50,2],[0,1],[50,5],[70,1],[50,1],[70,24],[90,2],[70,3],[90,1],[70,1],[90,1],[70,2],[90,1],[70,15],[90,9],[70,4],[90,24]